ucleotide sequence in 5’→3’ notation using standard single-letter codes. Sugar and linkage type may be expressed alongside, via .sugar and .linkage.\">sequence</span>\n            <a name=\"SubstanceDefinition.nucleicAcid.subunit.sequence\"> </a>\n          </td>\n          <td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">\n            <a style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: black; null; padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: black; null\" href=\"elementdefinition-definitions.html#ElementDefinition.isSummary\" title=\"This element is included in summaries\">Σ</a>\n          </td>\n          <td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">0..1</td>\n          <td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">\n            <a href=\"datatypes.html#string\">string</a>\n          </td>\n          <td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">The nucleotide sequence in 5’→3’ notation using standard single-letter codes\n            <br/>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: white\">\n          <td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAyAAAAACCAYAAACg/LjIAAAAMUlEQVR4Xu3LsQ0AIAwDwezq/WcAaqhSoDRn6ZqXXEmq42zdrWP6DwAAzHkCAADALxtMUUAsbN3VPQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==)\" class=\"hierarchy\">\n            <img src=\