       fhir:definition [ fhir:v "Disulphide bond(s) between cysteine residues on the same subunit or across two different subunits. Positions are listed in increasing order of subunit number and intra-subunit position, followed by the amino-acid abbreviations. The positions should contain Cysteine residues." ] ;
